WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.750
Moving things need no force to keep going, only to change their motion.

2
00:00:05.526 --> 00:00:09.801
With no push, friction is the only force, so the puck slows down.

3
00:00:17.957 --> 00:00:21.432
Now switch friction off, so there are no forces at all.

4
00:00:26.868 --> 00:00:30.743
It keeps going at the same speed: no net force, no change.
